# Skills

Reusable task recipes, one per subdirectory:

```
skills/
  <skill-name>/
    SKILL.mkd     # frontmatter (name, description) + step-by-step instructions
    ...           # optional helper scripts / references
```

Make `description` specific about _when_ to use the skill — that's what an agent matches against. Reference project docs by relative path back to [`../guide.mkd`](../guide.mkd) and [`../architecture.mkd`](../architecture.mkd) instead of duplicating them.

These are plain files, not a tool's native skill feature. An agent uses one because [`../../AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) tells it to read this directory — so keep each `SKILL.mkd` self-contained and list new ones in the index below.

